# Runtime save data (player inventories, town/nation state, old test worlds) -- generated at
# runtime, not source. The pvp playtest map and its set warp points are the exception: both are
# real deliverables for the playtest, not regenerable, so they're tracked.
nodisium-data/*
!nodisium-data/nodisium-playtest-map/
!nodisium-data/vanilla/
nodisium-data/vanilla/*
!nodisium-data/vanilla/warps.json
